Subject: [PATCH] umi-0152

---
 bsd/dev/sweet_wlif.c | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 bsd/dev/sweet_wlip.c | 69 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
